      "created_at": "2016-01-06T16:27:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Where the real Sentinels money is made!</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Mezike\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/c6cbf5/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Mezike:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Your puns need a bit more wok Trajector.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Well, I wasn’t really frying to pun with cooking terms; it was more wordplay. But I ought to know that puns are the creme de la creme around here. I can certainly try to do batter next time.</p>",
